{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《玫瑰戰爭》最新一集劇情極具衝擊性，傅嘉莉（Kelly）飾演的菲雅因誤會丈夫有外遇，竟借醉意圖「生擒」馬國明飾演的德龍！畫面中傅嘉莉情緒崩潰，演技大爆發，更被眼利網民發現她激動得全身通紅，究竟這場戲背後她付出了多少努力？\n</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉借醉生擒馬國明 崩潰爆喊身體通紅</h2>\n<p>在第五集《玫瑰》中，劇情揭示菲雅（傅嘉莉飾）與丈夫家俊（陳展鵬飾）關係惡劣，全因家俊誤會她與好友德龍（馬國明飾）有染，更肆無忌憚地與小三Mandy（陳楨怡飾）來往。被丈夫數落的菲雅，在崩潰之下借醉向德龍尋求慰藉，更上演一幕「生擒」戲碼。傅嘉莉將角色醉醺醺又委屈的狀態拿捏得相當精準，有網民更發現，入戲極深的她激動得連身體都泛起紅色，演出極具說服力。</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉首演醉酒戲感恩網民：睇到我哋嘅用心</h2>\n<p>對於網民觀察入微，連身體泛紅的細節都留意到，傅嘉莉受訪時坦言非常感恩，認為這是對演員用心付出的最大鼓舞。她表示：「好感謝觀眾睇得咁仔細，睇到我哋作為演員嘅用心係對我哋好大嘅鼓舞。」這次是她首次挑戰演繹醉酒狀態，坦言事前做了大量準備功夫，才能在鏡頭前呈現出最真實的崩潰感。</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉揭排練秘聞：馬明好配合我去爆發</h2>\n<p>傅嘉莉透露，由於這場戲需要同時處理複雜的情緒、肢體動作，並要配合多個機位拍攝，難度極高。為此，她事前與對手馬國明進行了長時間的排練，並做了許多心理建設和構思。她特別感謝馬國明的專業配合：「馬明真係好好，佢好配合我去爆發個情緒。」除了這場爆發戲，二人在沙灘上的「和解」友情戲亦因真摯動人而掀起熱議，展現了角色之間深厚的情誼。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版式激讚傅嘉莉：連對腳都有戲！</h2>\n<p>傅嘉莉的傾情演出贏盡網民好評，討論區被讚美聲洗版。不少觀眾對她入木三分的演技表示驚訝，紛紛留言：「她是哭得連腿都紅了，整個人都投入進去了」、「連對腳都有戲」、「嘴唇都在顫抖，很有說服力。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_2269896176af96013157f5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_2269896176af96013157f5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_11292770306af960191bd23.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_11292770306af960191bd23.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_4998341936af9601e50b5d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_4998341936af9601e50b5d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_6368495726af960391621f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_6368495726af960391621f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_895195606af9603e46284.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_895195606af9603e46284.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_16716332446af96044bc6c7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_16716332446af96044bc6c7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_16763786766af960512a369.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_16763786766af960512a369.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_8635347116af9605aabbee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_8635347116af9605aabbee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:23:01.775989+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1064,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:57:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T16:38:12.880562+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:16:36.645906+00:00","content_hash":"a798056acdce5de2734ee1d0b2b25d9dd70302c4096bf041b493ef26073f36ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}